# W1-C keeps everything, as W1-A3/4/5 and W1-B do. Nothing here is ignored.
#
# Tracked as evidence, exactly as the harness, grader and fidelity gate leave them:
#   runs/H*/work_definition.json   the agent artifact, where one is produced
#   runs/H*/acp_transcript.jsonl   append-only ACP transcript + lifecycle records
#   runs/H*/harness_result.json    outcome, COMPLETE reason, per-turn log, hashes
#   RESULTS.md / RESULTS.json      the STRUCTURAL grader's record
#   FIDELITY.md / FIDELITY.json    the FIDELITY gate's record, reported independently
